# The DDS stack this bridge is built against.
#
# ⭐ THIS IS eProsima's OWN v1.2.2 COMBINATION, copied verbatim from that tag's
# ddsenabler.repos. Not a set assembled here: a release pins its dependencies
# to releases, and taking the whole of one is taking a combination its author
# has built and tested together.
#
# ⛔ NOT the repos file on `main`, which pins BRANCHES - master for Fast-CDR and
# Fast-DDS, main for the rest. Importing that means building whatever those
# branches held at that moment: two nightlies a week apart are two different
# pieces of software, and a commit of eProsima's can redden this image with no
# change of ours, looking exactly like our bug.
#
# ⛔ And not a raw commit, which is where this started. The bridge was developed
# against append_action_infix @ c44b086 - a branch eProsima asked people to use
# and has since DELETED, absent from git ls-remote, so a clean clone cannot
# fetch it. That work reached main as ad19575 ("Append action infix to action
# topics", #29), and v1.2.1 and v1.2.2 both contain it - checked with
# `git tag --contains ad19575d8b6691c9d46c53733ac040e6afeca998`. So the commit
# pin is no longer needed, and a supported release says the same thing.
#
# ⚠ THIS IS A JUMP FROM WHAT WAS TESTED BY HAND. The development machine carries
# Fast DDS 3.3.0, Fast CDR 2.3.0, ddspipe and dev-utils 1.3.0; v1.2.2 asks for
# 3.6.2, 2.3.6 and 1.5.3. The callback signatures this bridge implements are
# eProsima's, so they can move between those. The nightly image build is what
# finds out - and finding out on a schedule, rather than at a demo, is the
# reason it exists.
#
# To move the stack: replace this file with a newer release's ddsenabler.repos,
# run the nightly, read what it says.

repositories:
    foonathan_memory_vendor:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/foonathan_memory_vendor.git
        version: v1.4.1
    fastcdr:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-CDR.git
        version: v2.3.6
    fastdds:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-DDS.git
        version: v3.6.2
    dev-utils:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/dev-utils.git
        version: v1.5.3
    ddspipe:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/DDS-Pipe.git
        version: v1.5.3
    ddsenabler:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/FIWARE-DDS-Enabler.git
        version: v1.2.2
